<title>FINLAND: NOKIA ADR ENDS AT $58-1/4 (FIM 266.90).</title>
<headline>NOKIA ADR ENDS AT $58-1/4 (FIM 266.90).</headline>
<dateline>HELSINKI 1996-11-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Nokia's A share ADR rose $0-1/4 to $58-1/4 in New York on Friday.</p>
<p>Its Wall Street closing equals about 266.90 markka. In Helsinki on Friday Nokia A closed up 3.50 markka at 265.00.</p>
<p>Valmet's ADR (two shares) rose $-1/2 to $32-3/4 on Wall Street on Friday. The price equals about 74.00 markka. In Helsinki, Valmet rose 1.30 markka to 75.80.</p>
<p>Rauma's ADR was flat at $18-5/8 in New York. The price equals about 85.36 markka. In Helsinki, Rauma closed down 0.50 markka at 86.50 markka.</p>
<p>--Helsinki newsroom +358-9-680 50 245</p>
